================================================================================
HEARTBEAT DOCS — COVER IMAGE GENERATION PROMPTS
================================================================================

TARGET: docs.heartbeatchurch.com.au (BookStack instance)
OUTPUT: 880x500px landscape (2x of 440x250 display size), PNG or WebP
STYLE: Consistent across all images (see style guide below)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
STYLE GUIDE (prepend to every prompt)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Use this prefix for ALL prompts below:

  "Minimalist, modern illustration in a flat design style with soft gradients.
   Muted warm color palette (soft navy, warm cream, gentle gold accents).
   Clean, abstract, editorial feel — no text, no people's faces, no photorealism.
   Subtle geometric shapes and flowing lines. Landscape orientation 880x500
   (roughly 16:9). Suitable as a website card/cover thumbnail image. Keep
   the composition simple and readable at small sizes — avoid fine detail."

Then append the specific prompt for each image.

