================================================================================
NOTES FOR GEMINI
================================================================================

- All images should feel like they belong to the SAME visual family
- No text in the images — BookStack overlays the title automatically
- No photorealistic human faces — keep it abstract/illustrative
- Landscape 880x500 (2x retina of 440x250 display size) — BookStack will
  flexibly scale & crop to fit different UI contexts
- Keep compositions SIMPLE — these display as small card thumbnails, fine
  detail will be lost
- Keep the visual weight toward the center (edges may be cropped)
- Muted, warm palette throughout — avoid harsh/saturated colors
- The three campus covers should clearly be a matching set with city-specific elements
